  "description": "Our 2027 Maxwell 275 is here and shipping NOW! This mountain bike is a super lightweight 27.5 inch full suspension trail bike designed for tweeners, youth and even smaller adults. It delivers an unsurpassed ride quality without the weight penalty of typical trail bikes in the category. A premium aluminum frame and premium level components help us build bikes starting at just 27 pounds! Choose from four build levels including GX AXS electronic shifting, multiple tire options and even upgrade to a burly Rock Shox PIKE fork options in multiple travel options for even greater enduro-ready performance. With so many cool build and configuration options, no production 27.5\" bike in the category can do what our Maxwell 275 does out on the trails!",
